{
  "name": "Spark - Comet (Gem Draft v2)",
  "author": "UtkarshBehre",
  "description": "Gem and passive-tree draft. All skill and support hints cover character levels 1-100; normal gem requirements still apply. Listed supports include alternatives and successive tiers, not a single simultaneous socket setup. Passive stages follow the supplied screenshots for levels 1-16, 17-21, 22-37, 38-52, and 53-80. Shared nodes use weapon set 0; PoB red paths use set 1 and green paths use set 2. Attribute choices are hover notes and must be selected manually; some change between stages. The two Remnant Pickup Range nodes used at levels 22-52 are replaced by a different pair at level 53. Passive recommendations end at level 80; no later tree or ascendancy has been supplied. Gem level progression and separate non-crit/crit versions are deferred. Cast-on meta entries remain experimental. Manually socket Flame Wall and Fireball into Cast on Elemental Ailment before the crit swap, then into Cast on Critical afterwards, with the listed trigger supports. Zarokh's Refrain is a Lineage upgrade, not a cuttable gem. Format: https://www.pathofexile.com/developer/docs/game#buildplanner ; gem names and item IDs: https://poe2db.tw/us/ ; passive IDs: https://github.com/grindinggear/poe2-skilltree-export",
