      "id": "Metadata/Items/Gems/SkillGemCastOnElementalAilment",
      "level_interval": [1, 100],
      "additional_text": "<b>{Cast on Elemental Ailment}\nRequires a level 14 Uncut Spirit Gem. Base reservation: 100 Spirit.\n<green>{Use before the crit swap.}\nManually socket Flame Wall and Fireball as the triggered skills. Planned supports: Boundless Energy I/II, Ignite II, Energy Retention.\n<yellow>{Experimental: GGG documents meta gems as unsupported. Verify this recommendation in-game; the same setup is recorded on Flame Wall and Fireball as a fallback.}",
