      "id": "Metadata/Items/Gems/SkillGemCastOnCritical",
      "level_interval": [1, 100],
      "additional_text": "<b>{Cast on Critical}\nRequires a level 14 Uncut Spirit Gem.\n<green>{Replace Cast on Elemental Ailment after the crit swap.}\nOriginal planning note: +90 Spirit. Current gem data lists 100 Spirit base reservation; verify the effective reservation and available Spirit for your character.\nManually socket Flame Wall and Fireball as the triggered skills. Planned supports: Boundless Energy I/II, Ignite II, Energy Retention.\n<yellow>{Experimental: GGG documents meta gems as unsupported. Verify this recommendation in-game; the same setup is recorded on Flame Wall and Fireball as a fallback.}",
